        "title": "Critical Infrastructure Sectors",
        "category": "other"
      },
      {
        "text": "AsiaInfo Business Support System (BSS) contains multiple vulnerabilities. In the worst case, a remote, unauthenticated attacker could provision a new account with administrative privileges or take over existing accounts, and perform other administrative actions. ",
        "title": "Risk Evaluation",
        "category": "summary"
      },
      {
        "text": "Fixed in BSS version 9.2.41 and aether-menu version 2.2.7.",
        "title": "Recommended Practices",
        "category": "general"
      },
      {
        "text": "United States",
        "title": "Company Headquarters Location",
        "category": "other"
      }
    ],
